{{!
    @template tool_vae/text_list

    A list of lines of plain text. It breaks a line after its opening tag and after each item, as html_writer::alist() did.

    Every text comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\text_list. The template holds no logic. Every value is
    escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lines - list of {text}: each line

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lines": [{"text": "RNCP36832-C03 (on this site: Accompagner)"}, {"text": "and 2 more"}]
    }
}}
<ul>
{{#lines}}<li>{{text}}</li>
{{/lines}}</ul>
